a-note=\"8c48c66841a15eb9\" href=\"?note=8c48c66841a15eb9\" title=\"67-df-provability-conditions\">67-df-provability-conditions</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f76c99f69499336d\" href=\"?note=f76c99f69499336d\" title=\"67-thm-fixed-point-lemma\">67-thm-fixed-point-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6fca065df2bf5fac\" href=\"?note=6fca065df2bf5fac\" title=\"67-thm-godel-first-incompleteness\">67-thm-godel-first-incompleteness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Theorem 4(a)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"25–26"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"36–37"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 使用固定原始递归公理呈示与标准证明公式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\\)</span> 成立，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9f0e08fd1022847c\" href=\"?note=9f0e08fd1022847c\" title=\"67-df-consistent\">67-df-consistent</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d404f437f90ff5f6\" href=\"?note=d404f437f90ff5f6\" title=\"67-df-consistency-statement\">67-df-consistency-statement</a>；标准 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8c48c66841a15eb9\" href=\"?note=8c48c66841a15eb9\" title=\"67-df-provability-conditions\">67-df-provability-conditions</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BL}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T)\">\\(\\mathrm{BL}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T)\\)</span>。固定点与 PA 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"f76c99f69499336d\" href=\"?note=f76c99f69499336d\" title=\"67-thm-fixed-point-lemma\">67-thm-fixed-point-lemma</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}_T.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}_T.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 2.4(a), pp.25–26 以 PA⊢T 和选定 PR 公理呈示为条件。证明按原书：固定点 G↔¬Prov_T(⌜G⌝) 与 BL 条件给出 PA⊢Con_T→G，若 T⊢Con_T 就有 T⊢G，与第一不完全性矛盾。旧条目仅写 Q⊆T、把标准导出条件泛称藏在说明中；现明确基础与条件。一般弱算术版本不冒充本书此定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-PA","status":"resolved","id":"cd051851df5d2aa2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-PA]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"9f0e08fd1022847c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"d404f437f90ff5f6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-consistency-statement]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-provability-conditions","status":"resolved","id":"8c48c66841a15eb9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-provability-conditions]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-fixed-point-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"f76c99f69499336d","anchor":"ref-